{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2022-08-29 07:00:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL BOLSTERS PRIVATE MARKETS OFFERING WITH ACQUISITION OF PRIVATE MARKET CONNECT', 'text': 'NEW YORK , AUG. 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P GLOBAL (NYSE: SPGI), PROVIDER OF CREDIT RATINGS, BENCHMARKS AND ANALYTICS, HAVE ANNOUNCED THE FULL ACQUISITION OF PRIVATE MARKET CONNECT (PMC), A DATA SOLUTIONS PROVIDER IN PRIVATE MARKETS. THE ACQUISITION WILL INTEGRATE INTO THE MARKET INTELLIGENCE DIVISION AND FURTHER EXPAND THE BREADTH AND DEPTH OF ITS DATA SOLUTIONS AND OFFER HIGH-QUALITY DATA IN A TIMELY MANNER AS A SINGLE-POINT SERVICE TO LIMITED PARTNER (LP) AND GENERAL PARTNER (GP) CUSTOMERS.'}